# Canonical identity for this repository.
#
# The same person has committed under more than one display name. A .mailmap
# maps them to one identity for `git log`, `git shortlog`, `git blame` and
# GitHub's contributor views. It rewrites nothing — every commit keeps its
# original SHA and author record.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

Ye Htut Aung <yehtutaung.yha@gmail.com> yehtutaung <yehtutaung.yha@gmail.com>
